# Trivy findings accepted on purpose. Each entry says why; remove it when the reason no longer holds.

# Dockerfile has no HEALTHCHECK: the default command is a batch run that exits, and the API's
# liveness and readiness probes are defined in the Helm chart, which Kubernetes uses instead.
DS-0026

# Workloads in the default namespace: the chart takes its namespace from `helm install -n`;
# Trivy renders it with the default release namespace.
KSV-0110

# Images from trusted registries only: enforced by cluster admission policy, not by the chart.
# The image repository becomes ghcr.io/organized-ai/podcast-agent with the GitOps phase.
KSV-0125
